+							*modeline-strict*
+The 'modelinestrict' option restricts which options can be set via a
+modeline to a fixed whitelist.  This is enabled by default, for security
+reasons: it avoids unexpected or harmful side effects when opening files
+from unknown or untrustworthy locations.
+
